   "text": "men, 'five of them probably innocent,' is taken as a matter of course, without unfavorable comment by the press of the State in which the murder occurs; that in another State a citizen, able to read and write, resents the use of the word 'mob' as applying to 'the good citizens who hang up a worthless Negro,' and he regards murder by the mob as an economy, since thereby the feeding and sheltering of a prisoner are saved his county. The name of the county is 'Emanuel.'",
   "status": "ok",
   "confidence": 0.9733641743659973,
   "lines": [],
   "bbox_ocr": {
